            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A) If a Step Two answer is not given within five (5) working days following the Step Two meeting and the Union wishes to process it further, the Union shall give the Company written notice within fifteen (15) working days following the Step Two meeting that it has decided to submit the grievance to informal arbitration, designating a Union Informal Representative in the notice.",
