            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B) If the Step Two meeting is not held within five (5) working days after the Company's receipt of the written grievance and the Union wishes to process it further, the Union shall give the Company written notice within twenty (20) working days from the Company's receipt of the written grievance that it has decided to submit the grievance to informal arbitration, designating a Union Informal Representative in the notice.",
