        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If the parties do not meet within the fifteen (15) working days following receipt of the Union's notice, the Union may notify the Company's Informal Representative of its intent to meet and select an arbitrator in accordance with Article XXV, Section B.",
