        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Grievances that are general in nature shall be processed in accordance with the provisions of B.1., Step One of this Article, excepting that the oral discussion will include the Senior Steward, Department Steward, the Labor Relations Representative, and a member of Management who has authority over the matter. Grievances not settled in Step One may be reduced to writing signed by a Business Representative and filed with the cognizant Labor Relations office within fourteen (14) working days following the event or events on which the grievance is based. The grievance will be processed in Step Two of the Grievance Procedure. Grievances that are pertinent to Designated Organization policies or procedures arising from the terms and provisions of this Agreement shall be referred in Step Two to a member of management who has authority over the matter.",
